<title>SPAIN: Spain industrial output rose 17.7 pct y/y in April.</title>
<headline>Spain industrial output rose 17.7 pct y/y in April.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute gave the following provisional figures (percentage change):</p>
<p> INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION		  APR 97    MAR 96  APR 96</p>
<p> Yr/yr					17.7	 -0.2   +0.9</p>
<p> Avg yr to date against yr ago	 4.9	  0.8   -1.7</p>
<p> Calendar-adjusted yr/yr		12.5	  4.0   -3.2</p>
</text>
